  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-26T21:17:40.113Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently VRChat mirrors can be set to scale based on your headsets resolution\nBUT are hard limited to a max resolution of 2048x2048\nProblem with this is on high res VR headsets, mirrors look pixelated and bad. Considering that most people see half of this game through mirrors, this is a big problem.\nAs more high res headsets get released, this will inevitably become a larger problem, as it already is for anyone with a high res headset like a Pimax or a G2.\nSo please, increase the limit.",
